ve/folders/1guSsSQb4-l6Rzb0jkFDIRiZPtXew2pKC", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hiyasi_ki/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3740381, "client_id": 3618668, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ce77a8d1/uploads/origins/9cde450b-1986-4e09-aa13-6997644f3b80?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e512f3d08543b6973a1551e8bd243602", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ce77a8d1/uploads/origins/9cde450b-1986-4e09-aa13-6997644f3b80?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e512f3d08543b6973a1551e8bd243602, https://si.imgix.net/ce77a8d1/uploads/origins/9cde450b-1986-4e09-aa13-6997644f3b80?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fff5470a940bf5db72c382a9d052980e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ce77a8d1/uploads/origins/9cde450b-1986-4e09-aa13-6997644f3b80?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8839bc9f9acacaefeb6cd1009635e48c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ce77a8d1/uploads/origins/9cde450b-1986-4e09-aa13-6997644f3b80?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=91f0496eb334cb247cfea6bd75afed07", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ce77a8d1/uploads/origins/9cde450b-1986-4e09-aa13-6997644f3b80?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=91f0496eb334cb247cfea6bd75afed07, https://si.imgix.net/ce77a8d1/uploads/origins/9cde450b-1986-4e09-aa13-6997644f3b80?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8503bd1c54a02b470b250ccd16d971a7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ce77a8d1/uploads/origins/9cde450b-1986-4e09-aa13-6997644f3b80?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=86a93467918a8f51bdbca1fb9451a206 3x"}, "body": "您好、ご招待いただき、ありがとうございます。私もあなたのスタイルがとても好きで、私の設定のためにイラストを描いていただければ嬉しいです。\n私の設定には二つの性別があり、共通の特徴は亜麻色の髪と小鳥のような灰色の瞳、左目の下に小さなほくろがあることです。男性の場合は不良少年で、女性の場合は腹黒い性格です。あなたはその中から一つの個性を選んで創作していただき、他の部分（シーンや服装など）については自由に描き加えていただいて結構です。カッコいい一面を見せるだけでいいです。\n可能であれば、psdファイル内の別のレイヤーにサインをお願いします\n依頼内容に何か難しい点か問題点があれば、お気になさらずこの依頼をキャンセルしてください\nご検討のほど、何卒よろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://weibo.com/7796893802/5210121873654778", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hiyasi_ki/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3740381, "client_id": 3739802, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b76e6748/uploads/origins/41077672-92aa-4ad0-bf1c-60ab35c533ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=062f3f1eeb864838dcefaf35bf66af0f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b76e6748/uploads/origins/41077672-92aa-4ad0-bf1c-60ab35c533ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=062f3f1eeb864838dcefaf35bf66af0f, https://si.imgix.net/b76e6748/uploads/origins/41077672-92aa-4ad0-bf1c-60ab35c533ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c4e094275dd1ca374797289cbcaac585 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b76e6748/uploads/origins/41077672-92aa-4ad0-bf1c-60ab35c533ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6ad6cc83209e3f8e822c58f36a0c53da 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b76e6748/uploads/origins/41077672-92aa-4ad0-bf1c-60ab35c533ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=621dc58512981078a38b3ce065271697", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b76e6748/uploads/origins/41077672-92aa-4ad0-bf1c-60ab35c533ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=621dc58512981078a38b3ce065271697, https://si.imgix.net/b76e6748/uploads/origins/41077672-92aa-4ad0-bf1c-60ab35c533ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=be2399928e47a6d1a27cd9ee419538b8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b76e6748/uploads/origins/41077672-92aa-4ad0-bf1c-60ab35c533ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d1f8ccaafd1932334ddf2374e98b775c 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I was truly drawn to the free, wind-like atmosphere of your works 🥺 I’d love to invite you to draw my OC. Here are her traits and requests:\n\nComposition: the pose can be up to you. I’d love to see a blue tone like a clear sky—imagine her, many years later, on a sunny afternoon suddenly recalling a playful moment with someone who has long vanished. Since she cannot fully understand this emotion, it’s not sadness, but rather a gentle sense of loneliness.\n\nOC Personality: she is a bound spirit, shaped in the form of the house’s owner . She is harmless and naïve, most of the time she’s clumsily imitating humansand. After the owner passed away, she continues to linger in the now-old corridors and courtyard.\n\nRepresentative flowers: bellflower, blue butterfly.\nNotes: her eyes are green mixed with red 🥰\n\nThat’s all for the requests. I truly love your art 🥺 and it would be wonderful if we could collaborate 💍 Thank you so much for reading!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1lRKbpKNcpW0pAOY1jUR5NaMfGsAbNS1B", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 492924, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "エイゴニ", "screen_name": "eisuri", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1262578213672202246/VMjpGqpK.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/801718896881324032/1591199555/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_cre